		{
			"id": "n-ui",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Tauri v2 WebView UI (macOS + Windows)\nReact 19 · ui-sdk 0.1.0-beta.17 (Apache-2.0) · Tailwind 4\nDockview 8.9 (MIT-only) · LWC v5.3 + ISeriesPrimitive\nRaw WebGL2 Orderflow · Canvas2D DOM/Tape\n(ADRs 0001, 0002, 0003, 0004, 0010)",
			"x": -520,
			"y": -60,
			"width": 350,
			"height": 175,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "n-ipc",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "04-Architecture/IPC-Contract.md",
			"x": -110,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 135,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "n-core",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Rust Core Process (allegedly-*, Apache-2.0)\nPer-Provider rtrb SPSC → Single-Thread Dispatcher\nIngest (Kraken/Coinbase/DBN/.bi5) · Fixed-Point i64/i128\nOrderflow 32B Slab + 16-ary VRVP + u128 TPO\nStudies: Native → Wasmtime v51 → Luau (mlua)\nOMS + WAL + Kill-Switch + In-Process BrokerAdapters\n(ADRs 0001, 0005, 0006, 0008, 0009)",
			"x": 190,
			"y": -75,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 205,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "n-brokers",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## External Venues & Retail Brokers\nMarket Data: Kraken WS v2 · Coinbase WS · DBN · .bi5\nIn-Process Clean Brokers: Local Paper Sim · Alpaca\ntastytrade · IBKR (rust-ibapi MIT)\n4 Prop Firms + Rithmic/CQG: DO-NOT-BUILD\n(ADRs 0008, 0009)",
			"x": 190,
			"y": 355,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 155,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "n-data",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "04-Architecture/Data-Model.md",
			"x": 190,
			"y": 175,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "n-storage",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Local-First Tiered Storage\nHot: Dedicated Storage rtrb SPSC\nWarm: .atvault / .atdepth + SQLite WAL\nCold: Hive Parquet 2.0 Zstd (4.26 B/tick)\nSettings-as-Code: workspace/template/analysis/theme.toml\n(ADR 0006 · S05 · S08)",
			"x": -210,
			"y": 175,
			"width": 350,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "n-plugin",
